{"benchmark": "ifeval", "task_id": "1082", "sample_idx": 8, "model_name": "nvidia/llama-3.3-nemotron-super-49b-v1", "content": "As he opened his eyes, the familiar surroundings of his apartment seemed off. The couch was in the same spot, the TV still blared the morning news, but something was amiss. It started with the clock on his nightstand - its digital display flickered with an otherworldly glow. Then, he noticed the subtle pixelation around the edges of objects, like the rendering of a freshly loaded game. A shiver ran down his spine as the truth dawned on him: he was inside a video game. Memories of his life began to feel like scripted quests, his relationships like NPC interactions, and his job a repetitive side mission.\n\n***\n\nThe realization sent him into a frantic exploration of his newfound digital reality. He approached the window, and instead of the expected city view, he saw a \"Loading...\" screen briefly flash before the scenery rendered. People on the street below moved in loops, stuck in perpetual animation. Determined to grasp the extent of his situation, he turned on his computer, only to find the desktop filled with game development software and a document titled \"Player Character Bio - John_Doe_v3\". The more he discovered, the more questions he had. Who controlled this game? Could he escape, or was he doomed to play out his programmed existence? And what lay beyond the boundaries of this digital world?", "logprobs": [{"token": "As", "logprob": -0.7100075483322144}, {"token": " he", "logprob": -0.13329587876796722}, {"token": " opened", "logprob": -0.14526593685150146}, {"token": " his", "logprob": -5.960462772236497e-07}, {"token": " eyes", "logprob": -2.3841830625315197e-06}, {"token": ",", "logprob": -0.00012373158824630082}, {"token": " the", "logprob": -0.023396845906972885}, {"token": " familiar", "logprob": -0.18689987063407898}, {"token": " surroundings", "logprob": -0.5970811247825623}, {"token": " of", "logprob": -3.45706348525709